<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεισ-ίον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outhouse, shed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς οἰκίας τὸ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.129
			</span></i> (here perh. =
			<i>brothel),</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).158
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				287
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				146
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				35.243
			</span></i> (ibid., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ephes.</u>
				2.75
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>: pl., <i>sheds</i> for cattle, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				40.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shrine, chapel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				33.72
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cappadocia</span>). [First syll. long in <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
			</span></i> l.c.; written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεισίον</span>
			<u>IG</u> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				35l
			</span></i>.c., Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.356
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.415
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
			</span></i> Dion.l.c.; later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλις</span>-
				<u>Ephes.</u>l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				33
			</span></i> l.c., freq. in codd.; prob. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίνω</span> as 'lean-to', 'penthouse', rather than fr.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλείω</span> as stated by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.50
			</span></i>.]</div>
